OL,3,GNEWSAMurder charge after man found
OL,4,Astabbed to death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder over
OL,7,Fa fatal stabbing in Maidstone.
OL,9,FKent Police said officers attended
OL,10,Freports of an assault at a property in
OL,11,FKnightrider Street at about 22:20 BST
OL,12,Fon Monday.
OL,14,FA man in his 40s was found with
OL,15,Finjuries consistent with a stab wound
OL,16,Fand died while being treated by
OL,17,Fparamedics. Two people were later
OL,18,Farrested on suspicion of murder.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
