OL,3,GNEWSAMurder charge after man found
OL,4,Astabbed to death
OL,5,
OL,6,FBradley Patton, 26, of Gordon Road,
OL,7,FGreater London, has been charged with
OL,8,Fmurder and will appear at Medway
OL,9,FMagistrates' Court later.
